## Development

Run commands at the workspace root using `pnpm --filter {{packageName}} <command>` or from this directory with `pnpm <command>`.

- `check:types` - Run TypeScript type checking
- `check:lint` - Run ESLint linting
- `check` - Run all checks
- `format` - Format code with Prettier (run at workspace root: `pnpm format`)

## Structure

- `src/` - Source code
- `src/lib/` - Library modules and utilities
- `src/lib/constants.ts` - Centralized constants

## Getting Started

Install dependencies at the workspace root:

```bash
pnpm install
```

Run checks to verify setup:

```bash
pnpm -w check --filter {{packageName}}
```
